    <a class="liquid-glass" href="/consulting/"><div class="service-card-media"><video data-home-video muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-hidden="true"><source src="https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P/hf_20260324_151826_c7218672-6e92-402c-9e45-f1e0f454bdc4.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div><span>02</span><h3>AI Consulting</h3><p>Work through technical choices and workflow challenges.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a>
    <a class="liquid-glass" href="/implementation/"><div class="service-card-media"><video data-home-video muted loop playsinline preload="none" aria-hidden="true"><source src="https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_38xzZboKViGWJOttwIXH07lWA1P/hf_20260307_083826_e938b29f-a43a-41ec-a153-3d4730578ab8.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video></div><span>03</span><h3>AI Implementation</h3><p>Design and build systems around practical requirements.</p><b>Explore service ↗</b></a>
  </div></div></section>
